{"data": [{"author_id": "215237888", "created_at": "2026-11-17T13:15:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122679905796431873"], "id": "2122679905796431873", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AgentStarterKit Nice! I have a similar workflow, but currently running on OpenAI dots.", "url": "https://x.com/kaspars_z/status/2122679905796431873"}, {"author_id": "1536677609974779909", "created_at": "2026-11-17T13:01:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122676417053774251"], "id": "2122676417053774251", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 89, "id": "1318419526132862976", "start": 76, "username": "NousResearch"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/marketplace/bi…", "end": 659, "expanded_url": "https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/marketplace/birta", "start": 636, "url": "https://t.co/0CmZ76giJF"}]}, "text": "Nearly 1,000 plugins were submitted to the Hermes Agent Plugin Hackathon by @NousResearch. Ours is one of them.\n\nWe built it because I'm sure the chat model is going away. You ask, wait, read, ask again.\n\nThis work is moving to autonomous agents like Hermes, Claude Duet and OpenAI dots. Claude Code and Codex will finally be tools for code, not for everything else.\n\nOur plugin is Artifacts for Hermes, built on Birta. Hermes publishes a report, a deck or a site at a link you can share, and people comment right on the page. With mention events on, mention Hermes in a comment and it makes the change and publishes the next version.\n\nhttps://t.co/0CmZ76giJF\n\nNow we wait for the judges!)"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nearly 1,000 plugins were submitted to the Hermes Agent Plugin Hackathon by @NousResearch. Ours is one of them.\n\nWe built it because I'm sure the chat model is going away. You ask, wait,